{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:efa853e1c8975a92f45b8c088c73d752a44c4ca356b5b1823cc0eced68149d48",
      "source_sha256": "7fded605614850a3ab10e8d843172358698e70da8d081c3d946a214468aaa7a2",
      "translation": "南部军的正规军，通常负责城市守备。雇佣兵则要上战场，拼命作战。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:842d1d1258be43c7a1c8bf6a9a4989a958cf1611f8d411b495be52702071d578",
      "source_sha256": "04ee088df6fd4be8b9398107798e95a72713a42ea1da1e75de2593190ee3c381",
      "translation": "总司令部的建筑很气派吧？这里原本是贵族宅邸，后来改成了南部军的设施。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:454629f4989f32acb38772aa35fc1914c6e226e149d5b93484562f0b18e787d7",
      "source_sha256": "c55200aa97af1bc53e9a5b3c6e65bf307f0b9995e30c16bffb5d81a364299e55",
      "translation": "阿巴泽特就像兰兹海姆的第2首都。虽然现在，是南部军的据点。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:28ee0de8fe7000afc1310a40930304941c179aa80414b56e25454fade3fd859b",
      "source_sha256": "35a52765b9972a88b7715c28db0b995fed3e1d35eb4fcd56ab9bb925b1ad8c66",
      "translation": "唉……我也想上战场立点功啊……那样，日子就能好过一些了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7283786e8c4e5b345e4343ee5b3d20f2dfd9b5f0f7143df443d8c26744fc1435",
      "source_sha256": "c3fc68d7b0f64566cc9999633beeb54c40cd8fd247e83caa3a2f96a20c9a1a19",
      "translation": "这该死的战争……我真是受够了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b360dad06e0931cc4ae21c450a76193b9af12f271bdd27692ec85f3d1fc8bd98",
      "source_sha256": "1f299dd8e4c0798701f3b589d42cdd42aaaffe3a834de8474dc4bed896f3812c",
      "translation": "这间是会议室。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:118f23d92e10fb842ac7c4c5e74af4f797e1355fe182d6ce1dcc46e1d53318ad",
      "source_sha256": "6e76a868c249e1647d22e74f73da078c8b1f5ce97336bf5eb172951b669d7873",
      "translation": "高层们主要就在这间屋里制定作战计划。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e15862ecec272070fffeee36ae166995fa21c3fe9033a90996e4a02ef03fd0c3",
      "source_sha256": "ea2b34c3d82cb4be9be3387eaff0c9ac1cf91ab595dd86cbefca1105fd79f85f",
      "translation": "和公主殿下一行分开后，我们奉劳德司令官之命，先行撤退了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c8b5b99fbe95c8fc7c5c2e42a998860672ed7dff7e625403833acb30c08f8b9a",
      "source_sha256": "c9aaa431402dd7a56122223123e7b39ab826d844b632ae3090ca7730d9bea2c3",
      "translation": "随后，立刻整顿部队，成功夺回了峡谷。劳德司令官果然厉害。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b58b2c766cd57e4b4e21d25a79c947bc9fbb2cc4c7131666c3e646cc0ef9e35a",
      "source_sha256": "219d9e671136506396be47910f0f19022d3b51cbd52471ae57432c417b770fd6",
      "translation": "这破会，开来开去，既没结论，也没个尽头！到底在搞什么！！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:162e73629784381fdce6fc079e8322ae29542607b018ff232772e68d978fbef5",
      "source_sha256": "fc2d3bd2c10c0173e09bcc6e7e1c46fc1a9798d4cc78fd30e11912cff6dc01e0",
      "translation": "虽然占领了老狐峡谷，可里面还留着残党。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0932073b330ef4af7ff7632b225d84322760d5be45e199a1fee089db0941b6cd",
      "source_sha256": "3394b999ed278b03d5599fef32bc0d511213d233fcaef6cffae0136d2615e73d",
      "translation": "也有些家伙，是为了钱才上战场的。听说，军费都是阿巴泽特的领主亚历克斯大人出的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9518006fd8294dda266798cc84ef5582ef1783d3c2fa41e7f5277abff57b6c1a",
      "source_sha256": "b38a88309ede8e94e2789a00caa653195be34d86b412dfa1fe47ac2f99bb206a",
      "translation": "他原本是个下级贵族，但财产相当可观。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:586330906b67809071dc30a2b3ed612348fe6f1081f89332addd26a2697a95ac",
      "source_sha256": "7949c21707289448cf69ca89ae54808623639c411c89d08529b15980b9d60d84",
      "translation": "我们特雷瓦族的故乡遭到毁灭，是因为黑角特雷瓦族的叛乱。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:abdff8f7dfc5056cedd92c440ae2ef8371fadc6a413f74a0b4571e7d5ffba562",
      "source_sha256": "919b017e554da0148ead52c8a31523d57113122e4b76c963f4308b6cd989b6a4",
      "translation": "最初，那场战斗是以青月特雷瓦族的胜利告终的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:181314f2822b285f6d65eed3b4aa3656f96ea88ec66fb0b3ae2e416f42da4d70",
      "source_sha256": "7e7c184165697bec6509a6e0a7ffdd75df698e6d9f3babbae548b8933d1af997",
      "translation": "可是，当时的族长不顾所有人的反对，没有将黑角特雷瓦族赶尽杀绝。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e455b0c936ee7621e9ff9e5d454131230fb537e3bb92403d97cfc3e2d79961c1",
      "source_sha256": "6c2f5e125fbb622e994800c5e603dbf62aa53287ec93230f7dfbe19590115bc6",
      "translation": "后来，黑角那些家伙再次入侵，残酷地践踏了我们的故乡。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c138eca2df253e2b0d081f3e8c29f944499d9be679d4bf66e65725b054636e5a",
      "source_sha256": "43c8e99476f6c10d6f8fd4aa06968c09e54abd09a594b80a8742d81c52cd0b06",
      "translation": "虽然只是传闻，但听说，当时黑角背后有修恩扎伊特撑腰。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5306a5b4d8d1ead9b7c2667331562901cd3b1c25aca7c7554e7fd2352b55acd5",
      "source_sha256": "a88cd1b5455765c7e51041190e3bce8b63f0614afddd62be4136145605ecebbd",
      "translation": "听说战争打得顺利，总算能稍微安心一些了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ab9bfadb9841ace1d3e5a1ebc9e265e9c1912b0a54a98cc24d05f36a13802e6e",
      "source_sha256": "121efff19242b6e136d910cf266a264115c296efa952373bedbc9dee8fa4e2b5",
      "translation": "听说，北部军出现了一位强大的女战士。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f0fb358b2155703e56e3b6c6c1b2342698c59df4d6bb579f966fbfef4ca8d055",
      "source_sha256": "6363fcca5f466831d8d945969077c5f4e0b018ae3d2e7d94e28d5e09400d8fa0",
      "translation": "虽然还不清楚她的身份，但大家都说，她的实力非同一般，务必小心。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:db82931b16970d3cf7d129262c127375fcb56c7e1c82d21d5135000935203346",
      "source_sha256": "75b5436fd8d9a629765327afb03b23eff14e87e827c4473e426547bd4d9c5c98",
      "translation": "听说，这次内战让贝尔福特几乎毁于一旦。相比之下，阿巴泽特还算好的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:570567d9d35f763b02c513695cab0f7689b4cb63471568cf3b6f04266bd1c4d3",
      "source_sha256": "7589f7fa5b1f82a71189a62b3a3d1d160d0ad55313edb6585ffc762c794588dc",
      "translation": "听说，您去过水色湿地？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a9afd7fa7bc0656f4c330fc1adaf3d7eae0cdc024825c304be6b94deabfb7392",
      "source_sha256": "26661c164586c8d5581ab3f6170383458bee21a41078f5fd7c18154bc8cf5cb4",
      "translation": "我听说，那里有很多灾祸种降临，您身体还好吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:491a53b353753f81ec4af0f52694ec4a4092b152d8d7fa3cafe6461dacc0ada8",
      "source_sha256": "477da08134e69642f037651bcc8eaf271f60aa230617501e49131d6369996324",
      "translation": "战争时期，也有战争时期的做生意方法嘛。嘻嘻呵～",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:66f90d20f3b9362eac7e5e321ef8091f1fc6deb3fd059b1bca8cbf691dfbf330",
      "source_sha256": "f72dfbf39fd1273b92b4ad8e3211beba81d7078bb6863384b14d81af8d8988cd",
      "translation": "卖卡蒙德啦～要不要做些饰品加工呀～？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fc3f5d32ccd27805dc05e3aecbe180fefd26c7295088e8e9c3486469536eb97d",
      "source_sha256": "afeeb14ab74023e850fad69120f966a6e0ae5d6b98ee10983fc6bcf21caf629a",
      "translation": "和马雷族结盟……再加上哨兵被毁，情况不妙啊……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f8e8d695d3d35ef45d86cf6193f24400fd8073829cee51c91d29425711d76ec6",
      "source_sha256": "0cf4b65591d3bb96c670854fc20c671d2a9a36f3a5bc75af50102b20918a7c5f",
      "translation": "什、什么啊！我……我才不是间谍！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:258d8616e0f2a62a70ccf3e7e2af6d0a87bd755b9a8b727f6b9b79c4d914a585",
      "source_sha256": "d2bde1842fafe3aa18aa6fa56155a689773da6b219ce8eca0a07d4dde5ac7998",
      "translation": "我听说，发现了一条海底洞窟。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:02cfb2405bc0f47426c40950644693ed61aac38f08d825d74f1b10e7292d344c",
      "source_sha256": "25e28ca655f42c33dc3ed53ca4d6a99d7192fb447db9dca68ae36ff4fd3c5ea2",
      "translation": "要是能利用那条洞窟，今后的战局也许会发生变化。真让人期待。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fe7cae11c8abccf7787c8d09ef5feca4580177167f0c79918c3f55d443d30588",
      "source_sha256": "19d556e916403eee02a899b872ef3f499dd0daa7cbe0f141416424982ad562f7",
      "translation": "听说，各位这次大显身手了。辛苦各位了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:128bda6385ac029e3d204366b1d0da0e07258388d59098c94e031f49d3fb848b",
      "source_sha256": "620f9684737e049ef755b6e92f306f005e0de33ed3508a4bc29f10eeff2ce075",
      "translation": "这里是南部关卡。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e2b5ac5fab70d955e031c262eac99a993abfb757e7634fc272cd472c3a51154d",
      "source_sha256": "2371bab44a61b4f8425612b48a89c19bbbce324107375237fe1e93deb98d6475",
      "translation": "穿过这道门，就能前往[寂静荒野]。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8630492e3167bded5282a03b0c422a8f7763728547898240d7772d9ea48dcc31",
      "source_sha256": "2f1ed50ef8a44e24d77e9a0a51c96ff7003902037f58878c76b71fcf52c49d8f",
      "translation": "请小心凶猛的野兽和拉提族。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a7171d8328634f1859fe473018bd031c09008c4e8e3c1b5a4b48d99d5b553a6c",
      "source_sha256": "d359ee838f8092346c5320f5a93f855ddcd83c7b2df4f543d3375025cca00ee4",
      "translation": "听说，公主殿下在老狐峡谷失踪了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3f81c8e27c4dd4c5a38ae3fe788070776744e0e93260297eb3579bfc54825acd",
      "source_sha256": "693850b30509eb1de9bc5d2add182383953c43e53a6319df4b56135aa6f26f40",
      "translation": "听说，公主殿下与柯塔马雷的马雷族结了盟。这下，胜利就在眼前了吗！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:aec47905a2dffaefe907733647dd34d62a176cd1512e84f647c4a419017d9dc8",
      "source_sha256": "c24c9f5e3903a72d722469739f77afa53ef7bd763d75662ddfb1a4dc00bc0e91",
      "translation": "听说，你们打败了北部军的哨兵，是真的吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d5b589a745df187f0e50f998e699968670681c67d361cb5d74c0a84d56029e73",
      "source_sha256": "1562368cb698df712ad6ba844cf0e7c826d39327a4fe1185d2bd48f9df90fe11",
      "translation": "反哨兵部队真是厉害啊。那才是真正的精锐部队……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1d2b5351350453f426df6a674659615e7bdc4f805c0aa3d12fa59f668b749cf0",
      "source_sha256": "4ad7ccffbd515b8cf2f63f7080388b0d84b96482100e7f047bc61086682d3c51",
      "translation": "反哨兵部队，最近似乎开始大展身手了……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cac70a199d5f1c633f98e627bc79b10f33f0a2d50a470da8c0e7624ee08bb76d",
      "source_sha256": "e265b3eee0ec420780c6371992cd923f0281409a752c88f12df7732e48aa28e9",
      "translation": "尤其是那个……叫什么来着，朱特……？听说，那家伙挺强的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f85a1cefc66c2c20be8c5be21b45d495465cb786b0351eae824d42136f4393bc",
      "source_sha256": "93f06528af96598ec2d0acaf0be30bc664d1aae2c90f4eea06afeb146b65bb8d",
      "translation": "老狐峡谷啊……以前，那里也有个小村子。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0120b27bb813f05facf2bfa101412e2cb6e31e3b172e2806a642853e216ca755",
      "source_sha256": "2b0e18a264c07c2b00e171977bc8f3a881f3f0b7fef1d60d91b42386df3bee2d",
      "translation": "不过，因为北部军的哨兵，如今连痕迹都没留下。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:96fbcfa784eeab759a0f22b4571cb1d86a23a6d63586e52ef4e4f556ed490921",
      "source_sha256": "62287fb2e87dc87d04ecca561f46f877b3d687365dcedd2f1e185b3122930e4f",
      "translation": "听说，过不了多久，就要向杜南丘陵出击了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dd06d0e41c2a193962d99cc5f6f4f11203b3328f678a78b72622c9695b13f32c",
      "source_sha256": "ad00a253f6eb727467ef9360916f517a82d17822543e89bc468e1baac63e31cd",
      "translation": "集中精神！不然，下场战斗死的就是你！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:171f83cc37160da2f80ab0be125cb06cf460b891079111f929af78ccf92811b0",
      "source_sha256": "e41c536a85518abc2435c12a73c615b9a8485f1f8e1be0a1e7979bd0cbbef9db",
      "translation": "带着这种松懈的心态，你以为自己能从下一场作战中活下来吗！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:df3857042d8773a090c4d44fa77834d3b5121cc4a97e46bf4790618c459c3cd4",
      "source_sha256": "7b24961a867c8673adb1f640b4fa7df83d3b3c821c03a6dcdba6e29154de561d",
      "translation": "手腕再用点力！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:07ac3bc96962490def8adc9a73b166643e13e6e92a3e3ad1b69c751b518c8727",
      "source_sha256": "ffdb694db43fe2b21a438730677699daaf1f65025075631676dbf45c0a57a9ae",
      "translation": "劈得再狠一点！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9a328b08b9577d86031f80e22e1f76d4a31353ef88bc89831f1929206e512a4f",
      "source_sha256": "a258f72883696018aab6070c2c85a224399e1015a9f2ee7c97eb90a1c29dac16",
      "translation": "哨兵看起来几乎没有智慧，可它们确实具备分辨敌我的能力。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9a4d6d823136e93626bdb732022372be10bf86f71251ef0c13c779858eea189b",
      "source_sha256": "82df72b4a1e35763b85fb949be1c3ee7d7e104420b38da5bd72aed5f71fe4cf2",
      "translation": "毕竟，它们是以斯特拉斯大人制造的守护者为原型。应该有这种程度的能力吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2424bd8ea0c31da6cdfad3edee8d7b84a733982b4197932b92ad55dac130ee5d",
      "source_sha256": "83e52a43cd26268e2852782e6ec14aa259d02de72ba675fc439a5acb59c6ba83",
      "translation": "不过，真奇怪啊。古文书记载，只有极为出色的连环术师，才能制造守护者。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9981bd7e3bd90a2504c31644fbdd9af583ffd6e3524490b422fb048a688fcedd",
      "source_sha256": "6705e308fd5fe83f79e9aed98af7fd948fe354c21679952e99f46ef404e75b16",
      "translation": "可是，修恩扎伊特不是个剑士吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a61e9a438840a659c3da92179124fb7ddd6933aa33b449dd22e24b80442d56a3",
      "source_sha256": "4637f53a83ecbb67596c30b9216f2b9e2e6901f1a3ed9abaa21f756e56df0199",
      "translation": "就是说啊。到底是怎么回事呢。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d8e77974863f73cefe3291408586f9333db647488339040e8d655d612ea1ba5a",
      "source_sha256": "b814e1390fc9fb1adc15d29549fc87ea5efa77d471ad45abf0cff00d5f592a12",
      "translation": "看来，这次我们部队要负责这一边。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:93cd60f190d308ffc3ed1f2c5c75d69d5faa86bfda2c3b31bebdbfba5ee1ac7d",
      "source_sha256": "68e6ff2683b1112a18eae128b0d96b0ce216f1d045be7afa759e23edd6f457cd",
      "translation": "我们部队负责这边。得充当前锋，扰乱敌军。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2adf496332b8aa1a85f78dbbce5f5eaf245a8467315b6a836d9f61feee347d69",
      "source_sha256": "5d96f413f5521e7c7b683f1a6b44058fe5b5824ad15c39d042b5f2416b0e0197",
      "translation": "可恶，这军旅生涯，真是倒霉透了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0083b8bad7a44d1d4894c3776955638463a3dc171e6a19a5031d4dfb8d232590",
      "source_sha256": "c921a1a5ac5ed2daf2d895deca07b32be8b78ea952acbb9f07100ccad0f12a70",
      "translation": "行行好吧。赏几个钱吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c4926ef23cc2e1716e1f91eedcc4347a530de287017d517db9ec854845e32a93",
      "source_sha256": "e0b8f47d061660d700d4ce81f34f3770407417aff0566149c923ccf9db0f5e78",
      "translation": "老爷，求求您，帮帮我吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c3aa47abbbad845401ab47533a4da09cbccee6c738ed7846c73d1caeb763ccb0",
      "source_sha256": "43ae84ec7360d244da58bd647804a3756d2ac9d47f07c1772daa0041d7c869cd",
      "translation": "还有必要，这样悲惨地活下去吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5e5f6a4febf15eadef466a5797f62c85d3e315b14df2d6cb87959d404cae10cb",
      "source_sha256": "c5e46ceeba6f8dce49245aef572d7fb57193ad9368010f5508090913683fe587",
      "translation": "这样活着，还不如死了……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9d22158fca3ced7337fb42710be5df705fb514d9320e3184188888673d1401d1",
      "source_sha256": "7c53495aba170b7834399782bd147ddb6b1af6979b319ebefd3c33d646fcfb45",
      "translation": "让一让，让一让。我正在打扫。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a95f3fc37e6af11a498ccbfaa8428b128afaebf9d771c374b65ab9d283b920c9",
      "source_sha256": "876a5194716efecfbe68e5c5086cea49f32e28439ce794be4ecdd373e5f7fe50",
      "translation": "唉，真累啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:571862138a2ae6b3fa8a00fde023d0091c478357872b07456b93a7de38fb25e2",
      "source_sha256": "d303fbbb510f8e2afbc0e537f8accda1d43f95186e6a4cae6c60f2d64de4abe4",
      "translation": "难民越来越多，广场也越来越难打理了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9a82087d7911e2a0212edf8b70ff78ee0ef3de3ea8216d296c56bf2c885ab38a",
      "source_sha256": "64288ab964bfde537697edba4274ffa3782725a4cd3c00a9f6ed2647748a722d",
      "translation": "不过，这种时候，还能有份工作，就已经很幸运了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:648b5d3809609c513625a7d44d387fba1c97d2871d1f18046fc7e8e327451255",
      "source_sha256": "297051e59c3b5144a6ca867242c35ef52b32726337e59432582fe93429d03c25",
      "translation": "有没有什么活儿可干……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bdc849077322d40a71d3a240e36b7e802ade147b76314aca62f2b3f2a83de06b",
      "source_sha256": "e0a343e3c38c143a695a6eb3557745f241677402fcd244338097a0af6533fb82",
      "translation": "我什么都能做。洗衣、打扫都行……呜呜……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:226cd3cff72d7349e6aebcc239b899b71daff9afb450dd27327ad0403bd056bf",
      "source_sha256": "205c141b53b2eedd995a68e38be0564ee3c852eb7497ee8d440689858be19b71",
      "translation": "前面是总司令部。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1d0d94fabab3c1347981fef7031bfa683f76114d61692ee816295f8bc2a32139",
      "source_sha256": "772942b177e9c3e38820b03e5d3e892e0392494837c2baf3fed2200d2f0d02a9",
      "translation": "未经许可，禁止出入。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4f1fcd93cf722540db9a5cf1a971a64a517ca2cdec4271c781c5ea070fc98f22",
      "source_sha256": "dd15df205d1805922a00585a5ee1016d173c184fce6d4db1079fd2e7cda0fba1",
      "translation": "虽然，这座斯特拉斯大人的雕像，只是根据想象塑造的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c7bc944cd76374ca3a80ae15ceca07fa15c15ff547e2a0af5943e200a578e0c8",
      "source_sha256": "1cfa3021baf17b3c5c0e3f25f52ac677c09efea08bc512ba0b9b6f81ec46900c",
      "translation": "可每次看着它，我都会觉得，自己也该做出一番事业。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:14471eac94965e9bc0d534c24277aa6290d829bf54a23582f9df10e112e97c9d",
      "source_sha256": "a02dbb8d7fe3e262246f20f50bc422408620100d5e9b017753bc2bfa87afa8af",
      "translation": "你不这么觉得吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e87837489a688cdd18a5b9a70fb31ef1d183f83077f7563fe1ab101cb2559895",
      "source_sha256": "b52f7120816b6673e7b2b790829fe770f5f9395f1a53828780ef654deeae3eb9",
      "translation": "听说，下一次作战是夺取杜南丘陵。你去过那里吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7896835cc015876457feb7580fb58ca39870dc753b917c7f2ddc167d1078133d",
      "source_sha256": "37b9a1fac3e71e4fecc4814e80b9defa67f03928b34dfa6116e77c6766f96639",
      "translation": "嗯。既然是丘陵，当然有坡路。沿途有不少哨所，顶端就是黑刃要塞。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b7790aaee0d29939cb7ac063bce2d48776e0c09d681b8e944d1db3a331a3eed8",
      "source_sha256": "0cb660910afe4211a8deb609b28f2751c0359067f26f5d7f6752adf58536d60d",
      "translation": "现在，每处哨所都有北部军把守，肯定不好打吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:54e5aacf074961bfcfed55219d3e915b483445e7d089adca9eccd92690d3033d",
      "source_sha256": "15317eff17eff678eca2f04d12bd4e813d123ecbd66217d98115507341f27375",
      "translation": "而且，那里的地形很难绕路，一定会是一场苦战。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3dd2f74358e98975daa9b02d10e7efd991f7a11696f895d98398474f3180967b",
      "source_sha256": "80705db2973c7a21bf1c48a6a925ee10deaa64fc148424b0c3e820c2ca4419be",
      "translation": "就这样，一路打到贝尔福特去！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8de35063b2ce8ff18e3c28d07ee252aa743306ebdaa7ec4190e2cef86802c982",
      "source_sha256": "9758909c18b48486a563ea2b1a9fcc63c257da4b8d1781ea5d6cab32b48be6c2",
      "translation": "只要有亚历克斯大人在，我们今后就不会再败！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:624a01029d357c8304f59fe9d6f0374b10239a201eebc8485b2242dfb0406147",
      "source_sha256": "0ecbb751600caec0ff33656f1d391e714ca0f9e3dc321d6439daf08a2c2ce2ad",
      "translation": "前些天，朋友炫耀说，自己买了一件用卡蒙德加工的饰品。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5c6ee4a0018fce0624019488bda16a8c7d058979ad924a295d8b99a9818197e2",
      "source_sha256": "af2fab0c9996c64f4af43bdee1dd6510d6692434db048b0eb63a2326d61b3cce",
      "translation": "我表面上装作不在意，其实心里别提多羡慕了……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:23cfd8ac9f22ac731812ad0d8fb73c28a2ff5b713399198f15a485f4938d2ef2",
      "source_sha256": "c9915c167e5fd9d0e948c6110b0c4eca2f14ff858f24e4ba8210ebb57b7d699a",
      "translation": "我在武器上装了新的卡蒙德，可威力并没有想象中那么强。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:70902626b66087a47af92f54ef8999a33f39c1b84e572a2f35d0494da3abce71",
      "source_sha256": "495de6e2465c4da1bb63a40aa7a29d7c05c6e0ba77149ba1e0f57e5b546827bd",
      "translation": "难道，应该买等级更高的卡蒙德吗？可那也太贵了……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bb9d444e1b47c22e2e649193c34592f93c49b331d829ee5e8344c57a4cd8443d",
      "source_sha256": "ce40c7dace55722ec857660079693e0543ec56ae3e14148e0a75229e782ef5c9",
      "translation": "最近，兵力实在太少了。哪还分什么正规军和雇佣兵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:504f5466dea32c77c16774f669e718f1be8c75ad54df36fc581adf8ef13b81a6",
      "source_sha256": "fdb8fe9bc5f7ed6ecdd04978e8e8cbb2a58087685cc3763e39aace133cdefb89",
      "translation": "一有事情，大家都得一起上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1603236ab360609dc993fc0182d92ebac566ec154496779307e6941b8c146c13",
      "source_sha256": "d853ae1724ec8ab4fb23c6c845763088d200c719184549fe88bbdd9968a2e66c",
      "translation": "去总司令部时，要注意衣着整齐！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:715756c4ef9a3464fcaad36305e09ee21ab5da351c1dd32a3a6b0034abbe38e3",
      "source_sha256": "7b400c588bb0f39ceaf5cff032cab49bdcb8b947d57fb60f93c82c6d15b8bea4",
      "translation": "听说，反哨兵部队最近立了大功。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ca07f88898f59d469cdc9377627db00a6ea4fd4c6c5cffd6b44b88c49bb4620d",
      "source_sha256": "5f279a4aa8af3a224075cac86d554becd8559ba1425088e97241f546c268d466",
      "translation": "从贝尔福特来的难民，越来越多了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:96bef08a9e81fb1304d5a121d95f29b5ed159f81b1a853923936b370c47233e7",
      "source_sha256": "88323f4ccd583740a71dce11ef08c32b93459e8ca8b92feff5dd3d2c85027f09",
      "translation": "说修恩扎伊特的疯狂已经蔓延到了这里，会不会太夸张了？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fa85aa603cfcf4c4694cf963f0588fe53643324336c2cbbf4dc4b2408945fab5",
      "source_sha256": "4cd61ce4345c4d334c9f6598fc432abeadb8f470f79cb3a5b5c402459a9457d3",
      "translation": "不知道什么时候会有新命令，所以要经常查看库布里的消息。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6b2eb1e8eb08b0be27210fe30ebdb14c649146f5c1f725395f02173cc1151fa4",
      "source_sha256": "e6a5b50c58fba21ccea9ff87ca7b187f8252e98ceaa36ec83425f181e2a8cc73",
      "translation": "上次，我没看到庆祝夺回峡谷的晚宴通知，真是遗憾啊……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e8a9065a9b61e35662d009240a910d104c0678e1184d72904af056ab1c2457c3",
      "source_sha256": "e33fc26e9d2363cf53dd8c92d8c8d5f65229fbf1ca0a462b97bf7bd82ec4533b",
      "translation": "里面是亚历克斯大人的房间，请注意，别大声喧哗。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:59475c6a5039d77c56918cc7ef5427ba27198e5da6728a5041b85d97751b6b67",
      "source_sha256": "d9472c046fa5f8014dbb0908cc55dacd617bf331aa46f1425379028c3e7b8b5c",
      "translation": "这日子真没法过了。我丈夫怎么这么没用……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:93d6d893b0b20a027ac642f45be42389dd89e537dcf8c0877127d173360583f3",
      "source_sha256": "7f6aff8898b43a5219018ca8df47a694920a3b11ec8b11543b92b0d72b12a6e2",
      "translation": "真是受不了了。怎么就这么爱唠叨呢。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ca5c7e968e49ab3a8f07838b0c4595d02806c352d19a336032d6580b7619c9c5",
      "source_sha256": "4319079902576f746d264707b1d5901f6258df2bb5a07740d59bd04ffbd40ae1",
      "translation": "向杜南丘陵出击的准备，都做好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ce13277895c0a18214eb5b23eb23d0762933957e9092b440d8cb20c6d0e0a5ef",
      "source_sha256": "b4524dc666a3782b5d44988b4839338abab74b60c77bb2964e807da7eeb75a55",
      "translation": "<Styles:MC2_StyleFont_0>X<Styles:/> 随时可以出发\\n<Styles:MC2_StyleFont_0>Y<Styles:/> 还需要点时间"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3a0a29359d87652a846b72233d5a17a869da1bc57d6718cbbfff3fa23ac870a2",
      "source_sha256": "0f0d6978bd27d803b7aa365a12e61336e5aec409488c39d23829bec8ca4fdb63",
      "translation": "准备完毕后，请再来找我。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dae69fc3972b78d30409bc1b052c83297ae64164cce957dd574df8aea16dd588",
      "source_sha256": "2ca2b45a32f2728aff34b26e9b44fb389b74df762c9c5eeeae71a40d481ee1ab",
      "translation": "既然各位已经准备好了，我就作个简短的战前简报。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9387ba39170946580831b543d8b7777de75cf77cdd1dcb46f03eb63954ca34e6",
      "source_sha256": "f3ad5cee8ac183aa57d77379d9e948da8b855a6b6cc4219beac5c3556e18b700",
      "translation": "请多保重。各位是支撑南部军最坚实的支柱。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ded53a3ee8ef1f047b8242177cab9932c9cf87a60c21be85fb1916f6c74b1c66",
      "source_sha256": "fe8a8d80589b6bd9dcab2ce4a622f5821d3f0d89d8ffc113cd1df44c1f314d4b",
      "translation": "(还有事没做完。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:beac0489f6f3c7f550fe9d482bbd9531ded0176273ea12413da79387cb218ea2",
      "source_sha256": "d71dcb58fd8efba4b8fcbbc347db51417cbfb12340278fa6a452280afe581a31",
      "translation": "(现在还不是回去的时候。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:44bfd7979a9355f57700420bdccd7df0cb7a4b5ad661b56373fa1f7bec2ad445",
      "source_sha256": "5dd3ac8ac8c34b88a54fa9293833170e03a83dc33b8afe52cc6ed903a7fd44ef",
      "translation": "(我们的目标是黑刃要塞。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:976c755fd8f6e63801bac9f57befe01e963df34672d7281bed0f10aa412d184c",
      "source_sha256": "3a8353fbefe863b991ad679837b5c2a3b71212cd5db5fc97f2a1f43841040f25",
      "translation": "(真的要回去吗？)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3a7eabf1862f816f27aca0a5161b78c79e030747f02be3e9868a332f67be29cd",
      "source_sha256": "da5a773a5bec277567711e6f00771d65b3fb88070fd58157d26a2c59eacb6cd4",
      "translation": "(喂，不是这边吧。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5ba74dd0aa18e4fd16a573f03c1970a1ec2f51b30eacfae55ecb94e62fdb0d6b",
      "source_sha256": "fc3e2c1dda483e7b7beca7f39764f8813d0bcd04a2f1b14d50e15878dd021545",
      "translation": "(北部军残党在另一边。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:833d9ccfa9a314e3831d7a9a468f9b40445c5a96b1d9822cf93445745b78d729",
      "source_sha256": "67fbc81957ef5cf5447b1dab42aa877198cde545cd8e4b21ea99c1c1d7313fac",
      "translation": "(没时间在这里磨蹭。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:14460f65d29d457a04aff96a67d0450f9759b3b9670d95c292f28c459107a030",
      "source_sha256": "b14f28b9cf60a56e70578c9b8b8da663e253ded22fac850865adc0914c889ea8",
      "translation": "(先清剿北部军，再回去吧。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:72a3a87cb870bb070b55fd4329cc25cb26ebebf07f4209de9d20301593f6b7eb",
      "source_sha256": "a8d654160fb7ef3ae6558c3ed7a7273aad50136fe769fd07286e39122264a7b7",
      "translation": "(我和阿尔戈的第一次任务，还没完成呢。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:da70303cb0ae3d4959bc42bbe72873105319df62e68fa7efaac7e643a986188d",
      "source_sha256": "1010cbad95d673e9c648f3e40638b9b58a2b420dfb21d586a9cabb126e77d1eb",
      "translation": "(先解决北部军，再回阿巴泽特吧。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:102a03b75e32591bb9b27d2d788fa9e58ffd9c8d0604e0911a2ab884e5d48821",
      "source_sha256": "bcea55c3f7b27cece59acdd58ff70fa52c1dedf939902462c28bded496a657de",
      "translation": "(北部军残党还没解决。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2aabdc3a7a66679bc2820da5c5e1f66a5307a8e1f0fcba6677f19e1e798f2902",
      "source_sha256": "25fba05e0058fc664db1d10b9e50607b7569e5e202d6a8e61f76e25359bcaa42",
      "translation": "(任务还没完成。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:36dbd18142654799fa409b91807171ea16d70f68e220adfc581684178e62342f",
      "source_sha256": "a6d360d48901d6fd7212cc151bd6a4b2534a644e21684444d76b4b910e169e74",
      "translation": "(还有北部军没解决。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:da7b66d05592acfc09a1f587184717a9c6bcedb705f9227e6372a01f4781b230",
      "source_sha256": "6cf5149fa43824eaaffb01753f69dba1a3ff372bd4a94f27097438ee5379c459",
      "translation": "(北部军还没清理干净。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:57c834532e87d1d6fc80adc524d5344eb95f06cca6171238b9ade53fe00eb610",
      "source_sha256": "541295250faa02036764cac21ba15100cf67b069b55e8f22b916a79fc26caf3a",
      "translation": "(不能丢下北部军不管。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:18c8a9f6cec8d70933d311442348d35730ee0be72ce89e1c2576f28f1703ec0c",
      "source_sha256": "6c19dbad19e0048f7715826639a2ad6045a138ca8a12bfbf3f753bcc7237d46a",
      "translation": "请攻下各处哨所，占领晶柱。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:df5f03d1ee5481da7245d2a075502d49fd75e1bff90d08899a53b80be6c72e58",
      "source_sha256": "14259297c6432c1f3c0f0b98c4bf3712770b2cc96da41d938cad8722d525f73a",
      "translation": "有反哨兵部队在，真让人安心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:48c13e7f1a2b42cd89e3bff557d913f810aae676bd7abb1638215432d02dba79",
      "source_sha256": "9c8e5eaf62f01771b6aae9c8fdbca24a248b1ce2dc373a41c88a286fdc28edba",
      "translation": "前往黑刃要塞，需要经过2处哨所。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2772599f57aab6fd7a4ffb7b522eeec62d5daf4338bd571711e40e485f646ec4",
      "source_sha256": "fdd68709aa82301e7aa8dacb14b699b907fca609e1e13e1a2d7f551d490ee0a1",
      "translation": "我们这里开设了临时商店。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ddfb88a4eaa3d826ae557fd6ef01065b6b81e83ad8ec973a9823bc8719187324",
      "source_sha256": "9baec6ed2e1a5b46f1f43acf528a7f414ae290ca3c767ab99ddf75db720175b8",
      "translation": "防壁的大门已经打开了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:706ec9884c9abab3e4e174ba7ecf2dafb5e66f4c1387f15d33e3845a42e32f82",
      "source_sha256": "56214b7e6ce5a2e589f1e4f1f70c246bbc05815e453fc074bec29b177a727751",
      "translation": "前面就是黑刃要塞。请多加小心。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6a5f0f02fed75b92bbeced0580aa64e8b0dad91d685acb4ce1eb3fdee904f7b1",
      "source_sha256": "ed2bc472b01c802953c2ea486f1bc0cf7af399d8396d312cd52b7898e55e71b1",
      "translation": "两处晶柱都已占领。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:34db5428f33c63c5f68f51bfa9927efacc35872cf0c51cd7cbeac6187fc2a766",
      "source_sha256": "0f1d45588f800656952c0430f08176b63382bfb40b16cbc0992946071c475ded",
      "translation": "我来为各位治疗伤势。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4967204e9c1b1e44bc8c4d6d6e8e3e4ad264a760fd964f3cf15e0f96510fda1b",
      "source_sha256": "0fbedfbb11730b560bf175eb217daabdb9cfcbdc0d7038ff7c47e3800b06801a",
      "translation": "(去黑刃要塞，不是走这边。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1b04800a0540877b7958016308406e2aca41d9160f7ac3701c95c4b1538326d5",
      "source_sha256": "ed566faebe858a93eb9d9683c93a794bd74b637cd45775ffecfce039f7ec7e9b",
      "translation": "(得先攻下黑刃要塞。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f04e9ae61a923d2742750c31235787de4899132c968ac9fcd70659e7d4ab3a7e",
      "source_sha256": "8f63385fe477b76d407da9e0f5eab77a0fb64d6bf05e5452816e231dd9e20410",
      "translation": "(首先，必须占领黑刃要塞。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:02839f73bb9bf09cad41fb19d318248a2d2c1c7aa8c9f927cc44a7b49b89098b",
      "source_sha256": "537b8910e53c3ff89470169e6ac9e5c1295c272fea705ebe8a97851a7e98507c",
      "translation": "(好像走过黑刃要塞了。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:065f70b36e92ad7f1aeadb290c9e9236043f6c5f7033dc21e96398a22e908d2a",
      "source_sha256": "7c1e15da61b0102591bb221ab9223dc961356924cc2ca560e223a2d7308f3201",
      "translation": "(还是先攻打黑刃要塞吧？)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ce8cbb7dfe26473f067b65e3cb65dad4363f801b7af7b8295590d27585f8187b",
      "source_sha256": "9e03cd4c3d2373b41dd05d66ef197f69c45cf7a77c0472f7468dad80a88c011a",
      "translation": "(看来，没必要继续深入了。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:763a2b56c2f4bdbbcc5e818e6d8bfbde8b7f98995f4c2b89d25855e101e7e9a9",
      "source_sha256": "9d3e539bd05bf81de711d70d764fe97a1f4dff80321617587a5c44edcf1913f2",
      "translation": "(还是避开无谓的战斗吧。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5ae5f6839b373587039575267a1a4f0fa00ac1f9f7d0cf93c7c62a5af354fc2f",
      "source_sha256": "25f816055f43e680db3ac9fd1d4126578ff8f96f9b3c8a118d4e7fffb81f1a63",
      "translation": "(应该没必要再往里走了……)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2ff70b000566977b8d7990aa19f438666b4d1212b5154249b42a51c156b13acb",
      "source_sha256": "0cb05b363bec055bbefa2dc41e1734a704afc841a9e60082cfbd4e3f207a3097",
      "translation": "(没有继续深入的理由。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d26bc76fede185158191d17633be9feeac1443d86fbfd0fa3236b5d9c6807a03",
      "source_sha256": "0b41cf29bba56739a5d5fcfb6ee2f7cb1056ff42a3f45ccea3b21194ab410bd8",
      "translation": "第1哨所的晶柱已经占领。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bef5296b50e236e63c9695d1d6652f57ee8013abb17631e758ba22979692e362",
      "source_sha256": "fdfb9a50d6fa5bc48beb72d6fbf494d16943d8a9f0965439bd2d7fea33c2e5c5",
      "translation": "据情报，第2哨所有一只叫[贝卡斯]的怪物。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8a552fe467658d1f66cedbab053bf033e9b3ff8600c8793fad0854c995df90fc",
      "source_sha256": "1325d299052f6e81b4e274502166559cdae69e91099e739fc4468e164f615d74",
      "translation": "听说，它会使用毒攻击，务必小心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ad9c35aa3dc808bb157507e67f7a573a44367cd66a4e6ed996742d2ec116a0e7",
      "source_sha256": "dac36cea325d3f2435b356f1f9acb9ba7413841919f2b3e507d6a2a6fee12ebd",
      "translation": "伪装成北部军的侦察兵，正在向我们传递情报。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a3d5f033324dd9268a488af4a93f87eeee7b948f3924637c00616ea6fd4ce3cf",
      "source_sha256": "a811bf4d825956734f7cb96341fc8e259169dce434cfb84635cd84d238ea747e",
      "translation": "多亏反哨兵部队，我们才能占领这里。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:39afc9193c4abc7619197642519e6c3d01e63992abeea5e597a0cb00cece4046",
      "source_sha256": "1ce76b8030668e403167336f3c82bba8fe080614d6923a2f45e3ec13a7bd3fa6",
      "translation": "北部军的新将领，剑术十分高超。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f0af05a48e622fa5dffda78abacc4356fd906bcff7f4102c292edd29ca0ced3d",
      "source_sha256": "8d56736d37a858b20e6fedce36166ffbca522c2a606f3434cef8c3cc9eb1ddc7",
      "translation": "虽然是位女性，实力却不容小觑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9c5bf7157e0974a864e5c411dd215b87057cae463f0784daa89c747a330e8698",
      "source_sha256": "2b2385285709ce325889b2d7e9af018d092048b76784646e648186ab12d414d3",
      "translation": "距离黑刃要塞，已经不远了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2cc85a841133a7762d5108d7c71f564582f6a869558c9b2f3d587e28df2bcd7f",
      "source_sha256": "279ccf58e6146fb714b1ef39bbbab664ce6134614e713744f76bb4c446c08536",
      "translation": "公主殿下的活跃表现，让士兵们士气大振。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ddeab33cede42e51ddd5fe5b5f116180856b3888f6765fd53b0cbecc72c1b6c4",
      "source_sha256": "48315c0080051a08bc87b8bae4e7fd9aaae851f6f5d9cfc9e6cb1cb2c9d9e082",
      "translation": "请保持这股劲头，坚持到最后。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3ccab37f45ea59bd21f6d918dd085cc29d361b2632095a0c33c3a0ee34954eb1",
      "source_sha256": "a027c0973ae8f2ce5502a9d25b0b459b0676ee04252969a54712ec6a4730053a",
      "translation": "多亏反哨兵部队，我们才能没有太大损失地来到这里。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bbf5f1b5576c353ce3a79e639427692d4404857dc623ce7ec95ce89590a307c3",
      "source_sha256": "0d86815cdcc87c32dbb31e741d4c8816a9a1db7ce3074ef1cb19dafce3a3a4fa",
      "translation": "有反哨兵部队在，果然让人安心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:521c1cbfd9162a804b2bc10e1edf68a3c988e8ccaf899ba0c7cdef5d63603b49",
      "source_sha256": "d2b74c5a040f5b84ce5699d1b654677eca1a14ffa7bd154bbfe1316fab243b95",
      "translation": "从这里开始，道路会变窄，请多加小心。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9796c73d53ef781301d1df0c03a5a35e923e3e3eb11cbf52aa50a2d3c69e3c0b",
      "source_sha256": "e086d18c02e2fa0026c089442a05588c8ddc3409340506d2d7e4c7ef4892a441",
      "translation": "(也没什么特别的事，应该没必要特地去海底洞窟。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bd18e446282b1cf74a69c7e2d802b77cb420b0f2f8a835b188491b712f04be86",
      "source_sha256": "7a9e45e4632211d270640570105215ec8a2d9733954e7224a555cfbda49d5864",
      "translation": "(现在，应该以任务为最优先。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2e9881c08b17265330f34dcd27c48f424ea50da8dba2fab23bf645c13414205b",
      "source_sha256": "d975c8ab51c72d78f002f0afe3b3a416be3c71f57d4a49eaa7c7021d19d5b831",
      "translation": "(海底洞窟以后再去吧。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d731af614757d4b75dd3343a62ce940131b829701578c7ad2f79f12b8888abfd",
      "source_sha256": "655d365e64bb5f8645e398a063a2c8f1d1ddaf9cccc09e301b3e8f373d1b8465",
      "translation": "(应该没必要去海底洞窟。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:880088ed628336fbd97b6147d830cb66299d3f44496fa8d8056381136b4996d0",
      "source_sha256": "3beac1168cba8eba2e68876afd673479caf8bb34865d546a9851ff12f67d062b",
      "translation": "(海底洞窟以后还能再去嘛～现在，我想待在阿巴泽特～)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2851fa61680d5fdf59e7f8525dbce5312089d98ec4d326607a0ca2c91a76a860",
      "source_sha256": "f3c3a9c446246e5af256ef81ba9af34d12747ff62e3a7e4622d5b01081dc1845",
      "translation": "(海底洞窟里到处都是水，呜，真讨厌。能不去，就不想去。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f5a1d523ad0295605bedf218386a1c1ecebd060dcd9a6f3bdcdada217b55ca4f",
      "source_sha256": "181a1d1520d24f13b89a795d4df76f98f35bf2ddfbebef4ef01010af743d83af",
      "translation": "(这边通往老狐峡谷。以后有事，再去吧。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c82dac29a122ef06f8da6b44f7dd4efcf871780e470e403aa66b1f443044bf43",
      "source_sha256": "d263aa2e6540da429e679117251846915891a80bec580c5d744aa5a3af3ef6c1",
      "translation": "(在老狐峡谷，已经没事可做了。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:14ddf1ebf558e04a6e6317981daa06a91e7c84ec2777917361e68a2c320bbd1e",
      "source_sha256": "1649c2abafd2dc6a0cccd294cd04b0bbda09f82e3c321bc7a700f0a8d30ee1cb",
      "translation": "(老狐峡谷的善后，南部军会处理好的，暂时就不操心了。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f48390666842870750afa6c62bde81ea3b65e599e24f0b86c26e81ffc8827267",
      "source_sha256": "a3c4df63155c8e9d627d47add5f33586f7602a241eafded1e005463010334567",
      "translation": "(现在，没理由去老狐峡谷。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6a6b3def729ada8ce3718263842281bbf79db42d6e94ad8d9f318275d961d077",
      "source_sha256": "6cbd87227ac8733cf10177e8e0eefc38f097a137524c144f59897fac0aba5851",
      "translation": "(老狐峡谷那地方，真是不适合我～以后再去吧。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:242957c3fa78fa7f55c24201022e872318f9bb4617cd33a31b0d7fe0c4d7b812",
      "source_sha256": "361d2de187706fbd7802bdfe7cb636fd4d0b09585e75aa7b20fc495e20d4c42d",
      "translation": "(我想先待在阿巴泽特。老狐峡谷以后再去。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:026181990e54736687fde77e0726f2b7ac3d63decc5033771bd852c26c6988a3",
      "source_sha256": "1f05721ab9d9942a0963f0a4a189803b4f1ff4c8842c892f12f429da50c647a2",
      "translation": "会议结束后……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4a46c2e29f9f887acfc642a6820affa38ea991d720ead86e1bb49be45b398715",
      "source_sha256": "fdd68709aa82301e7aa8dacb14b699b907fca609e1e13e1a2d7f551d490ee0a1",
      "translation": "我们这里开设了临时商店。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:114e250ff9fe6b9789735f8af88c1d9a0a56c535126c75c2fc6e3a114aec4e7c",
      "source_sha256": "859fab8a7821338357167ef4e1a596e7e543a21218730dd9c0e9a1ed1696320b",
      "translation": "(更深处没有我需要办的事。)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:272cac59e1ce46918cbba542849ad0ec74491febd6d3756e076ce4354a39d385",
      "source_sha256": "f95b63250387258069d356a6c00b3646eaa482176eb3a3500db582487b4ffdfd",
      "translation": "竟然连雷卡斯都击败了！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d1fa5f9e4d8c409a696e7411b3db2cc51e73bda7cb46230caf30159bd046c9aa",
      "source_sha256": "14259297c6432c1f3c0f0b98c4bf3712770b2cc96da41d938cad8722d525f73a",
      "translation": "有反哨兵部队在，真让人安心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:133cc401b13f189de40dea8597a81070c3d373d761dd4de1e0fe67481750ceb0",
      "source_sha256": "2b4f2e1c6cc0a83dddc7a17474ab7afc0a1d3340a816edaf6c5d1abdf642dce6",
      "translation": "应该正在前方的哨所等候。"
    }
  ]
}
